internal fun readerNode001138(): InlineContent.Text = InlineContent.Text(text = "Why children face backwards.")
internal fun readerNode001139(): InlineContent.Strong = InlineContent.Strong(children = listOf(readerNode001138()))
internal fun readerNode001140(): InlineContent.Text = InlineContent.Text(text = " A young child's head is relatively heavy and the neck is vulnerable. In a frontal collision, a rear-facing seat supports the head and body together, takes up collision forces and distributes the load across the supported body. The neck does not have to restrain the heavy head on its own in the same way as when facing forwards. This is why the recommendations above concern protection, not only seat orientation. Follow the seat's size limits, fitting instructions and airbag compatibility. ")
